  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint) | devDependencies | minor | [`1.11.0` -> `1.12.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@typescript-eslint%2feslint-plugin/1.11.0/1.12.0) |\n| [@typescript-eslint/parser](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint) | devDependencies | minor | [`1.11.0` -> `1.12.0`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@typescript-eslint%2fparser/1.11.0/1.12.0) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint</summary>\n\n### [`v1.12.0`](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1120httpsgithubcomtypescript-eslinttypescript-eslintcomparev1110v1120-2019-07-12)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/compare/v1.11.0...v1.12.0)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   **eslint-plugin:** handle `const;` ([#&#8203;633](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/633)) ([430d628](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/430d628)), closes [#&#8203;441](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/441)\n-   **typescript-estree:** fix `async` identifier token typed as `Keyword` ([#&#8203;681](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/681)) ([6de19d3](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/6de19d3))\n\n##### Features\n\n-   **eslint-plugin:** [ban-types] Support namespaced type ([#&#8203;616](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/616)) ([e325b72](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/e325b72))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** [explicit-function-return-type] add handling for usage as arguments ([#&#8203;680](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/680)) ([e0aeb18](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/e0aeb18))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** [no-explicit-any] Add an optional fixer ([#&#8203;609](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/609)) ([606fc70](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/606fc70))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** Add rule no-reference-import ([#&#8203;625](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/625)) ([af70a59](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/af70a59))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** add rule strict-boolean-expressions ([#&#8203;579](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/579)) ([34e7d1e](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/34e7d1e))\n-   **eslint-plugin:** added new rule prefer-readonly ([#&#8203;555](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/issues/555)) ([76b89a5](https://togithub.com/typescript-eslint/typescript-eslint/commit/76b89a5))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
